            <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; color: #0D2137; vertical-align: top;">Official $2,000 Part D out-of-pocket cap rules and $0 catastrophic phase implementation</td>
            <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; vertical-align: top;"><a href="https://www.medicare.gov/drug-coverage-part-d/costs-for-medicare-drug-coverage" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #0A3D3A; text-decoration: underline;">medicare.gov Part D Costs</a></td>
