          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: #4B5A6E; margin-top: 1rem; line-height: 1.6;">
      Seniors Audit is an independent educational platform. We are not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to CMS or any government agency. All calculations use official Inflation Reduction Act Part D rules.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       ELEMENT 8 — FAQ SECTION WITH SCHEMA
       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
